1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:04,199
Hermes lives where you do, and runs where
you want.

2
00:00:04,199 --> 00:00:05,871
First, where you talk.

3
00:00:05,871 --> 00:00:11,665
One gateway process serves Telegram, Discord, Slack,
WhatsApp, Signal, and the command line together.

4
00:00:11,665 --> 00:00:18,277
It transcribes your voice memos, and your conversation
continues seamlessly even if you switch apps.

5
00:00:18,277 --> 00:00:18,777
Now, where it runs.

6
00:00:18,777 --> 00:00:21,369
Hermes has seven terminal backends.

7
00:00:21,369 --> 00:00:29,876
Local for your own machine, Docker and SSH for servers, Singularity
for clusters, and Modal, Daytona, and Vercel Sandbox for the cloud.

8
00:00:29,876 --> 00:00:32,082
The serverless options are special.

9
00:00:32,082 --> 00:00:38,874
Your agent's environment hibernates when idle and wakes
on demand, so it costs almost nothing between sessions.

10
00:00:38,874 --> 00:00:45,075
That means one setup choice covers everything,
from a five-dollar V P S to a full G P U cluster.

11
00:00:45,075 --> 00:00:47,836
Chat from your phone, compute in the cloud.

